OL,3,GNEWSACommunity 'devastated' as Grade
OL,4,AII-listed Ugly House put up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe manager says she has been left
OL,7,F"heartbroken" as the Grade II-listed
OL,8,Fhistoric cottage in north Wales which
OL,9,Fhouses her business is set to go up for
OL,10,Fauction.
OL,12,FThe Ugly House, or TE7 Hyll, is a
OL,13,Ffamiliar landmark for Gwynedd
OL,14,Fresidents, and is believed to be linked
OL,15,Fto the Welsh tradition of tE7 unnos
OL,16,F(house in one night), where a house
OL,17,Ferected with its chimney smoking by
OL,18,Fdawn could be claimed by the builder.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
