OL,3,GNEWSACommunity 'devastated' as Grade
OL,4,AII-listed Ugly House put up for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Snowdonia Society, which owns the
OL,7,Fbuilding, is auctioning it at a guide
OL,8,Fprice of #199,000 and says the proceeds
OL,9,Fwill go "directly into Eryri's
OL,10,Flandscape, wildlife and people".
OL,12,FBut hundreds have signed a petition
OL,13,Fcalling on it to pause the sale and
OL,14,Fexplore communityb@Qfocused
OL,15,Falternatives.
